flowchart TD
    Launch[Open BacktestEngine] --> Configured{Setup completed?}
    Configured -->|No| Welcome[P01 Compact Welcome window]
    Welcome -->|Get Started: expand window| Style[P02 Simple or Advanced]
    Style --> Appearance[P03 System, Light or Dark]
    Appearance --> Agent[P04 Bring your AI agent]
    Agent -->|Connect| Connecting{Connection outcome}
    Connecting -->|Success| Finish[P05 Review actual configuration]
    Connecting -->|Failed or canceled| Agent
    Agent -->|Skip for now| Finish
    Finish -->|Back| Agent
    Agent -->|Back| Appearance
    Appearance -->|Back| Style
    Style -->|Back| Welcome
    Finish -->|Open BacktestEngine: save completion| Launcher[Project launcher]
    Configured -->|Yes| Launcher
    Configured -->|Interrupted setup| Resume{Last saved step}
    Resume -->|Layout| Style
    Resume -->|Appearance| Appearance
    Resume -->|Agent| Agent
    Resume -->|Finish| Finish
